<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Wage agreements important for rates - Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Wage agreements important for rates - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Friday that responsible wage negotiations were important to keep pressure off interest rates.</p>
<p>&quot;Responsible wage negoatitions are important to keep inflation down and get pressure off interest rates,&quot; costello told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;So both employers and employees should remember that when they sit down to negotiate,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
